# 1. Introduction

This week focused on connecting the frontend of the Istanbul Smart Tourism Guide application to backend services and real data. Until this point, most of the application content had been static and mainly used for interface development.

The primary goal during this phase was to make the application behave more like a real system rather than only a visual prototype.

The main work included:

* Connecting the mobile application to backend APIs
* Retrieving landmark information from a database
* Experimenting with LLM-based features
* Improving intelligent search and recommendation capabilities

These additions significantly improved the realism and technical depth of the project.

---

# 2. Objectives

The objectives for this week included:

* Connect the frontend to backend services
* Retrieve landmark data from a database
* Create API endpoints for search and filtering
* Test backend communication with the mobile application
* Experiment with LLM-based recommendations and smart search
* Improve error handling and loading states

